ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja482:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja482:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:11.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja482:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:12.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja482:13.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:13.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:13.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:13.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja482:14.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:14.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:14.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:14.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja482:15.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:15.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:15.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:15.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja482:16.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:16.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:16.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:16.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja482:17.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:17.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:17.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja482:17.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja482:18.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja482:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja482:0.2": "Terasakanipāta ", "ja482:0.3": "Ambavagga ", "ja482:0.4": "9. Rurumigarājajātaka ", "ja482:1.1": "“Tassa gāmavaraṁ dammi, ", "ja482:1.2": "Nāriyo ca alaṅkatā; ", "ja482:1.3": "Yo metaṁ migamakkhāti, ", "ja482:1.4": "Migānaṁ migamuttamaṁ”. ", "ja482:2.1": "“Mayhaṁ gāmavaraṁ dehi, ", "ja482:2.2": "nāriyo ca alaṅkatā; ", "ja482:2.3": "Ahaṁ te migamakkhissaṁ, ", "ja482:2.4": "migānaṁ migamuttamaṁ. ", "ja482:3.1": "Etasmiṁ vanasaṇḍasmiṁ, ", "ja482:3.2": "ambā sālā ca pupphitā; ", "ja482:3.3": "Indagopakasañchannā, ", "ja482:3.4": "ettheso tiṭṭhate migo”. ", "ja482:4.1": "“Dhanuṁ advejjhaṁ katvāna, ", "ja482:4.2": "usuṁ sannayhupāgami; ", "ja482:4.3": "Migo ca disvā rājānaṁ, ", "ja482:4.4": "dūrato ajjhabhāsatha. ", "ja482:5.1": "Āgamehi mahārāja, ", "ja482:5.2": "mā maṁ vijjhi rathesabha; ", "ja482:5.3": "Ko nu te idamakkhāsi, ", "ja482:5.4": "ettheso tiṭṭhate migo”. ", "ja482:6.1": "“Esa pāpacaro poso, ", "ja482:6.2": "samma tiṭṭhati ārakā; ", "ja482:6.3": "Soyaṁ me idamakkhāsi, ", "ja482:6.4": "ettheso tiṭṭhate migo”. ", "ja482:7.1": "“Saccaṁ kireva māhaṁsu, ", "ja482:7.2": "narā ekacciyā idha; ", "ja482:7.3": "Kaṭṭhaṁ niplavitaṁ seyyo, ", "ja482:7.4": "na tvevekacciyo naro”. ", "ja482:8.1": "“Kiṁ nu ruru garahasi migānaṁ, ", "ja482:8.2": "Kiṁ pakkhīnaṁ kiṁ pana mānusānaṁ; ", "ja482:8.3": "Bhayañhi maṁ vindatinapparūpaṁ, ", "ja482:8.4": "Sutvāna taṁ mānusiṁ bhāsamānaṁ”. ", "ja482:9.1": "“Yamuddhariṁ vāhane vuyhamānaṁ, ", "ja482:9.2": "Mahodake salile sīghasote; ", "ja482:9.3": "Tatonidānaṁ bhayamāgataṁ mama, ", "ja482:9.4": "Dukkho have rāja asabbhi saṅgamo”. ", "ja482:10.1": "“Sohaṁ catuppattamimaṁ vihaṅgamaṁ, ", "ja482:10.2": "Tanucchidaṁ hadaye ossajāmi; ", "ja482:10.3": "Hanāmi taṁ mittadubbhiṁ akiccakāriṁ, ", "ja482:10.4": "Yo tādisaṁ kammakataṁ na jāne”. ", "ja482:11.1": "“Dhīrassa bālassa have janinda, ", "ja482:11.2": "Santo vadhaṁ nappasaṁsanti jātu; ", "ja482:11.3": "Kāmaṁ gharaṁ gacchatu pāpadhammo, ", "ja482:11.4": "Yañcassa bhaṭṭhaṁ tadetassa dehi; ", "ja482:11.5": "Ahañca te kāmakaro bhavāmi”. ", "ja482:12.1": "“Addhā rurū aññataro sataṁ so, ", "ja482:12.2": "Yo dubbhato mānusassa na dubbhi; ", "ja482:12.3": "Kāmaṁ gharaṁ gacchatu pāpadhammo, ", "ja482:12.4": "Yañcassa bhaṭṭhaṁ tadetassa dammi; ", "ja482:12.5": "Ahañca te kāmacāraṁ dadāmi”. ", "ja482:13.1": "“Suvijānaṁ siṅgālānaṁ, ", "ja482:13.2": "sakuṇānañca vassitaṁ; ", "ja482:13.3": "Manussavassitaṁ rāja, ", "ja482:13.4": "dubbijānataraṁ tato. ", "ja482:14.1": "Api ce maññatī poso, ", "ja482:14.2": "ñāti mitto sakhāti vā; ", "ja482:14.3": "Yo pubbe sumano hutvā, ", "ja482:14.4": "pacchā sampajjate diso”. ", "ja482:15.1": "“Samāgatā jānapadā, ", "ja482:15.2": "negamā ca samāgatā; ", "ja482:15.3": "Migā sassāni khādanti, ", "ja482:15.4": "taṁ devo paṭisedhatu”. ", "ja482:16.1": "“Kāmaṁ janapado māsi, ", "ja482:16.2": "raṭṭhañcāpi vinassatu; ", "ja482:16.3": "Na tvevāhaṁ ruruṁ dubbhe, ", "ja482:16.4": "datvā abhayadakkhiṇaṁ. ", "ja482:17.1": "Mā me janapado āsi, ", "ja482:17.2": "raṭṭhañcāpi vinassatu; ", "ja482:17.3": "Na tvevāhaṁ migarājassa, ", "ja482:17.4": "varaṁ datvā musā bhaṇe”ti. ", "ja482:18.1": "Rurumigarājajātakaṁ navamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja482:0.1": "", "ja482:0.2": "", "ja482:0.3": "", "ja482:0.4": "", "ja482:1.1": "Tassa → kassa (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja482:1.2": "", "ja482:1.3": "Yo → ko (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) | migamakkhāti → … makkhāsi (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja482:1.4": "", "ja482:2.1": "", "ja482:2.2": "", "ja482:2.3": "", "ja482:2.4": "", "ja482:3.1": "", "ja482:3.2": "", "ja482:3.3": "", "ja482:3.4": "", "ja482:4.1": "advejjhaṁ → adejjhaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1); sarajjaṁ (mr) ", "ja482:4.2": "sannayhupāgami → sandhāyupāgami (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja482:4.3": "", "ja482:4.4": "", "ja482:5.1": "", "ja482:5.2": "", "ja482:5.3": "", "ja482:5.4": "", "ja482:6.1": "", "ja482:6.2": "", "ja482:6.3": "Soyaṁ → so hi (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja482:6.4":